WEBVTT

00:01.070 --> 00:03.440
Nothing about it in today's paper, either.

00:06.770 --> 00:09.240
<i>That monster with two magic stones...</i>

00:09.660 --> 00:12.400
<i>I wonder what that was about.</i>

00:12.960 --> 00:14.860
Good morning, dear brother.

00:15.320 --> 00:16.780
Good morning, Manicia—

00:17.120 --> 00:17.990
Huh?

00:19.520 --> 00:22.000
Could you read the paper to me?

00:22.000 --> 00:25.420
B-But you're good at reading and writing.

00:27.010 --> 00:28.490
Please read to me.

00:29.070 --> 00:31.120
<i>When Manicia asks for special treatment...</i>

00:31.120 --> 00:32.880
<i>she's so cute!</i>

00:34.840 --> 00:38.480
Labyrinths have been 
popping up frequently lately.

00:38.480 --> 00:40.060
I see.

00:41.340 --> 00:44.520
A labyrinth in Avancia, huh?

00:44.920 --> 00:46.730
<i>Come to think of it, the other day...</i>

00:47.390 --> 00:52.690
If a labyrinth appeared nearby, 
it would really revitalize the area.

00:55.790 --> 00:58.160
That article's about the 
royal capital's economy.

00:58.430 --> 01:00.370
That one's about a new policy.

01:00.810 --> 01:02.440
And that article is on...

01:02.440 --> 01:06.140
"Ex-Hero Kyglas Raids New Labyrinth."

01:06.520 --> 01:09.520
He was in your old party, wasn't he?

01:09.520 --> 01:10.380
Yeah.

01:10.660 --> 01:15.970
Ms. Nin says she doesn't like him
 because he makes fun of you.

01:17.540 --> 01:21.010
Nin's got a lot of personal 
feelings on the matter.

01:21.010 --> 01:22.430
I'm surprised.

01:22.430 --> 01:23.120
What?

01:23.120 --> 01:25.980
So you're aware of 
Ms. Nin's fondness for you.

01:26.970 --> 01:31.690
Do you pretend not to notice 
because of my illness?

01:35.250 --> 01:40.870
Maybe a little, 
but I'm the root of the problem.

01:42.990 --> 01:45.180
I'm a weak person, you see.

01:45.180 --> 01:49.800
When I get into that sort of relationship, 
I end up clinging to it.

01:50.390 --> 01:53.030
It prevents me from raiding labyrinths.

01:54.220 --> 01:56.120
I'm too clumsy.

01:56.120 --> 01:59.260
I probably couldn't do both at the same time.

02:01.090 --> 02:03.720
I think you'd be fine.

02:05.650 --> 02:06.590
So...

02:07.440 --> 02:11.860
Even if you find someone special 
and find happiness with them,

02:12.660 --> 02:15.770
please don't stop caring for me, okay?

02:17.310 --> 02:18.130
Yeah.

02:19.380 --> 02:20.470
Of course.

02:32.040 --> 02:41.880
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

02:32.040 --> 02:41.880
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

02:32.040 --> 02:41.880
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

02:32.040 --> 02:41.880
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

03:54.910 --> 03:56.460
O-Okay, everyone.

03:56.460 --> 03:58.750
We've called you all here today

03:58.750 --> 04:03.550
to take down the chameleon kong
 that was spotted here recently.

04:04.020 --> 04:08.060
Chameleon kongs are monsters that
 inhabit an area far to the south.

04:08.780 --> 04:12.750
It's hard to believe one made it 
all the way to Avancia without being seen.

04:13.480 --> 04:18.480
Therefore, we must investigate the reason 
for its appearance in addition to subduing it.

04:18.760 --> 04:22.660
Thank you for assisting us with this.

04:23.970 --> 04:29.370
Furthermore, it's likely the 
chameleon kong came from a labyrinth.

04:29.760 --> 04:33.010
So if you find an entrance, 
let us know right away.

04:33.390 --> 04:36.130
Huh? What's that?

04:36.380 --> 04:37.760
Oh, this?

04:37.760 --> 04:41.010
I had it made by a skilled 
father-daughter blacksmithing duo.

04:41.270 --> 04:43.300
Rud, here's your new sword.

04:43.300 --> 04:45.570
I polished up your shield, too.

04:46.010 --> 04:51.130
The sword is an impressive product on 
its own, but it has the Enchant skill, too.

04:51.130 --> 04:52.530
Wow.

04:52.530 --> 04:54.480
What's Enchant?

04:54.480 --> 04:58.940
Different elements can be used to change the
 magic stone's mana and enchant the weapon.

05:00.060 --> 05:01.900
It's probably best if I just show you.

05:02.540 --> 05:07.310
I can use magic of all elements, 
but not well enough to be useful for attacks.

05:07.310 --> 05:10.140
But if I channel it into this stone...

05:12.510 --> 05:15.290
I can turn it into a fire-type sword.

05:15.290 --> 05:18.420
<b>FWOOSH</b>

05:15.290 --> 05:18.420
<b>SKREE!</b>

05:15.810 --> 05:20.750
In other words, it can be used 
to target a monster's weakness.

05:18.420 --> 05:20.750
<b>SPLASH</b>

05:18.420 --> 05:20.750
<b>BURN</b>

05:20.750 --> 05:22.210
I see.

05:24.010 --> 05:26.190
You're F-rank, aren't you?

05:26.190 --> 05:28.160
That treasure is wasted on you.

05:28.160 --> 05:29.970
Hey, don't.

05:30.550 --> 05:32.930
You're C-rank, right?

05:32.930 --> 05:37.180
Yeah. There's no point in an 
F-rank wielding a good sword.

05:37.180 --> 05:40.110
Why don't you just head home now, old man?

05:41.360 --> 05:43.440
H-How <i>dare</i> that adventurer!

05:43.440 --> 05:45.690
Master, aren't you going to say something?

05:45.690 --> 05:47.400
Calm down, Luna.

05:47.400 --> 05:51.920
I'd rather be underestimated 
than overestimated.

05:52.380 --> 05:54.830
Well, maybe...

05:54.830 --> 05:58.500
But I don't like seeing you being mocked.

05:58.500 --> 06:02.540
See? People underrate you 
because you won't update your rank.

06:02.940 --> 06:07.760
You're actually strong enough for a 
saint like me to name you a knight.

06:08.080 --> 06:08.720
What?

06:09.040 --> 06:10.850
Is that true, Lady Saint?

06:10.850 --> 06:12.980
Yeah. He turned down my offer, though.

06:12.980 --> 06:13.930
But why?

06:14.270 --> 06:18.620
If you raise your rank too much, 
the guild will start summoning you.

06:19.920 --> 06:24.490
<i>Besides, I became an adventurer 
to cure Manicia's illness.</i>

06:30.990 --> 06:33.240
It's the chameleon kong! Above us!

06:37.200 --> 06:37.750
What?

06:49.130 --> 06:50.880
She's not bad.

06:50.880 --> 06:54.100
Yeah. Fille's better than 
your average adventurer.

06:55.720 --> 06:56.890
Provoke.

07:11.990 --> 07:14.240
<i>Each attack is heavy, but...</i>

07:17.960 --> 07:21.460
<i>They're managing to attack it 
without anyone getting hit.</i>

07:21.460 --> 07:23.680
Keep attacking, everyone!

07:23.680 --> 07:24.840
Yeah!

07:24.840 --> 07:26.630
<i>But why do I feel like something's off?</i>

07:27.320 --> 07:30.590
<i>Its large swings, 
its attention-grabbing roars...</i>

07:30.590 --> 07:33.800
<i>If it were human, its actions 
would make it seem like a tank.</i>

07:40.560 --> 07:42.500
What? There's more of them?

07:42.500 --> 07:44.020
No one said there'd be more!

07:44.020 --> 07:45.110
Get back, everyone!

07:48.190 --> 07:51.310
A diversion? But they're just dumb monsters!

07:53.380 --> 07:55.200
<i>We're surrounded.</i>

07:55.680 --> 07:56.790
<i>What should we do?</i>

07:58.420 --> 08:00.310
<i>I can't handle this.</i>

08:00.310 --> 08:01.010
Fille!

08:01.700 --> 08:04.110
As leader, your attitude 
will spread to the others.

08:05.760 --> 08:06.790
Leader?

08:07.260 --> 08:10.130
That's right. You're our leader, aren't you?

08:10.890 --> 08:11.590
Yeah.

08:12.050 --> 08:14.480
I know you'll find a way through this.

08:14.480 --> 08:15.300
Yeah.

08:15.750 --> 08:18.260
Let's reorganize!

08:18.770 --> 08:20.140
Provoke.

08:21.880 --> 08:23.390
Get in formation now.

08:23.390 --> 08:26.400
Hey! Taking on all three is too dangerous!

08:30.090 --> 08:32.820
Don't go thinking that's enough to beat me.

08:36.740 --> 08:40.710
I'll make you regret attacking my master!

08:40.710 --> 08:41.700
Wind Shot!

08:44.290 --> 08:45.870
Finish that one off!

08:46.100 --> 08:47.710
Gotcha! Let's do this!

08:52.450 --> 08:54.850
They should be able to handle that one.

08:54.850 --> 08:55.760
Now, what's next?

08:58.120 --> 09:01.470
If I recall correctly, 
chameleon kongs are weak to fire.

09:01.770 --> 09:04.180
Enchant: Fire.

09:10.420 --> 09:12.160
That was super effective.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.490
The rest is up to you.

09:13.760 --> 09:14.530
Got it.

09:18.820 --> 09:20.890
The guards will finish this one off.

09:20.890 --> 09:22.930
Yeah!

09:36.090 --> 09:36.800
Luna!

09:37.070 --> 09:37.760
Got it!

09:38.870 --> 09:40.100
Wind Shot!

09:44.980 --> 09:46.440
You're not getting away.

09:52.230 --> 09:55.350
This ends now!

10:07.250 --> 10:08.370
How are the others doing?

10:08.370 --> 10:11.440
We took down a chameleon kong!

10:11.440 --> 10:15.550
Nah, we wouldn't have been 
able to do anything without Rud.

10:16.350 --> 10:18.010
You're right.

10:21.430 --> 10:23.060
We beat ours, too.

10:23.770 --> 10:24.640
Great.

10:25.110 --> 10:28.320
You must be a monster 
if that situation didn't scare you.

10:28.320 --> 10:32.120
As a tank, I couldn't back down.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.170
I see.

10:34.510 --> 10:37.070
Listen, I'm sorry for making fun of you.

10:38.630 --> 10:43.200
It's fine. Rank is an indicator 
of an adventurer's skills.

10:43.200 --> 10:45.920
If someone's rank is low, 
it's natural to wonder what's up.

11:00.340 --> 11:03.790
<i>They died just like monsters in a labyrinth?</i>

11:03.790 --> 11:04.810
Rud.

11:05.030 --> 11:06.140
Look.

11:10.590 --> 11:13.340
A labyrinth entrance?

11:19.760 --> 11:22.910
A-A labyrinth has appeared in Avancia.

11:23.540 --> 11:27.620
May this lead to the further
development of the town. Cheers!

11:28.000 --> 11:29.580
Cheers!

11:29.580 --> 11:31.000
S'gonna get busy around here.

11:31.000 --> 11:31.920
Bring it on.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.500
Thanks for looking after my people.

11:36.640 --> 11:38.920
They're really celebrating tonight.

11:38.920 --> 11:44.140
Indeed. The appearance of a labyrinth 
may stop the town's population decline.

11:44.580 --> 11:46.540
That's great news, master.

11:46.540 --> 11:48.740
Yeah, I guess.

11:48.740 --> 11:50.850
Hey, Manicia.

11:51.340 --> 11:53.160
Wanna drink with me?

11:54.320 --> 11:55.980
Do you have a death wish?

11:56.800 --> 11:58.690
If you want to drink, I'll drink with you.

11:58.600 --> 11:59.440
I'm sorry.

11:58.690 --> 12:00.490
Looks like they're partying hard.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.050
Ms. Nin.

12:02.050 --> 12:03.450
Are you having fun?

12:03.720 --> 12:05.440
Yes, very much so.

12:05.440 --> 12:09.380
Although my master doesn't look too happy.

12:09.380 --> 12:13.050
Well, labyrinths aren't all good.

12:13.050 --> 12:14.810
He's probably worried about that.

12:14.810 --> 12:16.380
They're not?

12:16.380 --> 12:19.130
No. They come with all kinds of problems.

12:19.600 --> 12:22.710
If the labyrinth's monsters aren't defeated,

12:22.710 --> 12:26.720
they sometimes leave the labyrinth 
like those chameleon kongs did.

12:26.720 --> 12:31.380
If that happens frequently, it becomes 
nothing but a threat to nearby residents.

12:31.380 --> 12:36.610
Then, shouldn't they find folk to exterminate
 the monsters like we did this time?

12:36.610 --> 12:39.250
That comes with its own set of problems.

12:40.120 --> 12:43.390
Anyone can become an adventurer.

12:43.390 --> 12:46.820
In other words, even the worst kinds 
of people can become adventurers.

12:46.820 --> 12:48.370
Fille!

12:47.440 --> 12:52.660
It's not unusual for adventurers to follow 
around cute girls they see like stalkers.

12:52.960 --> 12:56.500
Those kinds of adventurers 
might prey on you or Manicia.

12:57.260 --> 13:01.470
Then, how should adventurers be organized?

13:01.470 --> 13:02.710
With clans.

13:03.390 --> 13:04.930
What are clans?

13:04.930 --> 13:08.930
<b>Party</b>

13:04.930 --> 13:09.300
<b>Clan</b>

13:04.930 --> 13:09.300
<b>Party</b>

13:04.930 --> 13:09.300
<b>Party</b>

13:05.380 --> 13:09.300
Clans are organizations of multiple parties.

13:09.050 --> 13:09.300
<b>Party</b>

13:09.610 --> 13:12.900
Adventurers who are part of clans 
are officially recognized by the nation,

13:12.900 --> 13:16.640
and are responsible for 
defending towns, like knights.

13:16.640 --> 13:20.400
Ultimately, even adventurers 
want stability, too.

13:20.950 --> 13:24.860
Entire towns can fall 
into ruin without clans.

13:25.480 --> 13:30.450
Avancia in particular has few 
combatants, so without a clan,

13:30.450 --> 13:34.390
it's possible the adventurers that end up 
here will just do whatever they want.

13:35.440 --> 13:37.750
<i>And if anything happened to Manicia...</i>

13:38.750 --> 13:41.290
Don't scowl so much.

13:41.670 --> 13:44.020
I'll help you, okay?

13:44.020 --> 13:46.020
Rud!

13:48.890 --> 13:51.810
Ah, this is so soothing.

13:51.810 --> 13:54.850
Q-Quit it, Fille. My absorb shield...

13:52.790 --> 13:54.850
Good boy.

13:54.850 --> 13:57.280
I'm gonna pet you.

13:54.850 --> 13:57.280
I can't breathe.

13:57.280 --> 14:00.230
Fille! You've had too much to drink!

14:01.640 --> 14:04.290
Hey! What are <i>you</i> looking at?

14:04.290 --> 14:05.740
You wanna go?

14:06.550 --> 14:07.740
You two.

14:08.610 --> 14:10.130
Are you fighting again?

14:11.030 --> 14:13.410
We're sorry!

14:15.940 --> 14:17.660
Nice work patrolling the town.

14:19.240 --> 14:21.760
It's been a week since 
the labyrinth appeared.

14:21.760 --> 14:25.040
I never thought this many 
adventurers would show up.

14:25.040 --> 14:26.130
Got that right.

14:26.790 --> 14:28.090
Mr. Rud.

14:28.090 --> 14:30.550
Thank you for your help the other day.

14:30.840 --> 14:33.510
Rud, if anything comes up, 
I hope we can count on you again.

14:34.270 --> 14:37.520
I hear you've been 
fulfilling a lot of requests.

14:37.520 --> 14:40.580
Just trying to control them won't work.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.940
Hey, there's a fight.

14:42.940 --> 14:44.300
This way.

14:49.780 --> 14:52.620
It's the Black Dragon Fang's
 number three, Boo,

14:53.160 --> 14:55.600
and the White Tiger Claw's
 number three, Gurly.

14:56.310 --> 15:00.540
Aren't they both A-rank adventurers? 
A fight between them won't end well.

15:02.750 --> 15:03.880
Wait.

15:04.490 --> 15:06.720
You're scaring the townsfolk.

15:06.720 --> 15:08.820
Could I ask you to stop fighting?

15:08.820 --> 15:10.320
Who are you?

15:10.320 --> 15:13.250
We're defending the honor of our clans here.

15:13.250 --> 15:14.890
Why don't you stay out of this?

15:15.310 --> 15:17.100
So you won't stop, then?

15:17.410 --> 15:20.820
In that case, why don't you 
settle something for us?

15:20.820 --> 15:25.770
Which clan should be allowed into this town, 
the Black Dragon Fang or the White Tiger Claw?

15:25.770 --> 15:29.780
We don't need either of you if you're going
 to cause trouble, so feel free to leave.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.290
Oh?

15:31.290 --> 15:35.370
You! Show some respect 
when talking to Mr. Boo!

15:38.080 --> 15:40.790
Stop wasting your time on this nonsense.

15:41.200 --> 15:44.250
Unlike Rud, I won't go easy on you.

15:45.840 --> 15:48.420
This town has its own rules.

15:48.800 --> 15:51.630
If you must fight here, 
then I'll take you on.

15:53.810 --> 15:55.080
We're sorry.

15:55.080 --> 15:56.620
We were wrong.

15:57.420 --> 16:00.290
Anyway, are you in a clan? 
You should join ours—

16:00.290 --> 16:03.810
Butt out, Gurly. The Black Dragon Claw
 is a much better fit for him.

16:03.810 --> 16:04.810
Black Dragon!

16:04.810 --> 16:05.480
White Tiger!

16:05.480 --> 16:06.270
Black Dragon!

16:06.270 --> 16:07.770
White Tiger!

16:08.380 --> 16:09.730
I won't be joining either.

16:10.150 --> 16:12.950
Come on, that's enough now.
 Welcome to Avancia.

16:15.650 --> 16:18.120
<i>They know when to back down.</i>

16:18.510 --> 16:22.580
<i>Clan adventurers are different 
from individual adventurers after all.</i>

16:22.820 --> 16:27.070
<i>But I doubt I'll be able 
to leave town for a while.</i>

16:27.070 --> 16:29.720
I didn't think those clans 
would try to recruit you.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.550
Yeah.

16:31.210 --> 16:34.010
<i>I once dreamed of joining a clan</i>

16:34.710 --> 16:39.470
<i>that operated like 
a family of adventurers.</i>

16:39.840 --> 16:40.930
Rud!

16:40.930 --> 16:42.580
What happened with the clan feud?

16:42.580 --> 16:43.800
It's settled.

16:44.610 --> 16:48.400
Then, please stop by headquarters as soon 
as you can. Mr. Vuild is looking for you.

16:48.790 --> 16:50.050
Mr. Vuild?

16:51.680 --> 16:55.320
The lord contacted me regarding the
 present situation in town.

16:55.810 --> 16:57.520
The lord himself?

16:57.520 --> 17:02.000
I was told to choose between two options.

17:02.000 --> 17:09.500
The first is for you to create a 
clan and become its leader.

17:09.880 --> 17:10.810
Me?

17:11.210 --> 17:13.390
But this is so sudden.

17:13.390 --> 17:14.670
It's not, though.

17:14.990 --> 17:18.700
People have been singing 
your praises for a while now.

17:18.700 --> 17:21.600
They say you're a young 
and skilled adventurer.

17:22.220 --> 17:25.060
I appreciate the compliments,

17:25.840 --> 17:28.540
but I have to cure Manicia's illness.

17:28.540 --> 17:30.520
I can't take on a position like that.

17:30.830 --> 17:35.940
I know, but it's also 
what the townsfolk want.

17:35.940 --> 17:37.950
Rather than bringing in an outsider,

17:37.950 --> 17:40.950
they want you to do it, 
even if you are inexperienced.

17:42.400 --> 17:44.160
<i>I appreciate the sentiment.</i>

17:44.870 --> 17:49.460
<i>If Manicia's illness is cured someday, 
I'd like to live a quiet life here.</i>

17:50.400 --> 17:52.770
<i>I'd like to help the town, too, but...</i>

17:53.200 --> 17:55.840
And the second option is...

17:56.720 --> 17:59.300
to destroy Avancia's labyrinth.

17:59.460 --> 18:02.260
What? But that would hurt
 the town's development.

18:02.260 --> 18:06.000
Numerous labyrinths have 
appeared across the nation.

18:06.000 --> 18:08.520
They can't afford to manage all of them.

18:09.020 --> 18:11.060
That goes for Avancia's labyrinth, too.

18:11.580 --> 18:15.740
They can't leave improperly 
managed labyrinths open.

18:16.140 --> 18:19.880
So if you're unable to form a clan,

18:19.880 --> 18:26.160
he'd like you to join the party currently 
exploring the labyrinth and destroy it.

18:26.880 --> 18:29.120
I hate to do this, 
but I'd like you to choose.

18:29.510 --> 18:33.420
Either become a clan leader and 
manage the town and labyrinth,

18:33.420 --> 18:35.460
or destroy the labyrinth.

18:35.460 --> 18:36.550
Which will it be?

18:44.220 --> 18:49.600
You don't need to decide right away, but
 I'd appreciate an answer as soon as possible.

18:50.050 --> 18:51.190
Hey, thief!

18:51.600 --> 18:53.270
You were tryin' to steal my stuff!

18:53.270 --> 18:54.930
I'm not a thief!

18:54.930 --> 18:56.720
I just made a mistake!

18:56.720 --> 18:58.080
Hey, cut it out.

18:58.080 --> 18:58.790
Shut up!

18:58.790 --> 19:02.240
You're just an adventurer! Stay out of this!

19:02.520 --> 19:07.310
<i>Is forming a clan the only way 
to get the situation under control?</i>

19:07.310 --> 19:09.210
I finally found you, master!

19:10.470 --> 19:12.760
Master, you must return to the house quickly.

19:13.770 --> 19:15.090
It's Ms. Manicia!

19:19.580 --> 19:21.470
Grandma Gigi, how is Manicia?

19:22.540 --> 19:28.000
She's fine. She's just feeling a bit
 under the weather as usual.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.180
I see.

19:29.650 --> 19:33.400
You worry too much, brother.

19:34.010 --> 19:37.360
More importantly, is the town all right?

19:38.310 --> 19:40.870
Don't worry about that. You should rest.

19:41.340 --> 19:42.210
All right.

19:47.170 --> 19:49.000
<i>If I became a clan leader,</i>

19:49.610 --> 19:52.510
<i>I wouldn't be able to leave Avancia for long.</i>

19:53.310 --> 19:56.830
<i>I wouldn't be able to visit 
various labyrinths anymore.</i>

19:57.960 --> 20:01.640
<i>I don't know if I'll ever find the 
wish-granting Secret Treasure,</i>

20:01.640 --> 20:05.930
<i>but if I stay in this town, 
Manicia will never be cured.</i>

20:07.200 --> 20:08.760
Nin. Luna.

20:10.270 --> 20:12.340
I'd like you to do something for me.

20:17.700 --> 20:21.030
I'm going to destroy Avancia's labyrinth.

20:21.720 --> 20:23.940
I'd like you to help me do it.

20:24.630 --> 20:26.580
Are you sure?

20:26.580 --> 20:31.000
That decision would deprive the town 
of an opportunity for development.

20:31.350 --> 20:35.010
If I have to choose between 
Manicia and the town,

20:35.810 --> 20:37.960
then I choose Manicia.

20:41.250 --> 20:44.470
Um, i-if I may...

20:45.700 --> 20:53.350
If you became a clan leader, 
would you have to stay in the town?

20:53.620 --> 20:54.310
What?

20:54.890 --> 20:59.760
If I became a leader, I'd probably 
have to stay until things settled down.

20:59.760 --> 21:01.280
Would you, though?

21:01.820 --> 21:06.740
Couldn't you choose someone to represent 
you and lead the clan in your place?

21:06.740 --> 21:11.030
Even if that were possible, 
I couldn't force someone to do that.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.020
If I...

21:13.040 --> 21:17.670
If I can protect the town 
in your place, then I will.

21:18.150 --> 21:21.740
I like this town that's been so kind to me.

21:22.530 --> 21:28.850
So just as you helped me, 
I'd like to help you if I can.

21:30.090 --> 21:31.310
But...

21:31.510 --> 21:33.770
Are you gonna hide your true feelings again?

21:34.790 --> 21:35.780
Nin.

21:35.780 --> 21:38.770
It's okay. I'll support Luna.

21:38.770 --> 21:41.050
I planned to quit being 
a saint eventually anyway.

21:41.050 --> 21:45.760
It's not what the church wants, 
but they understand at least.

21:45.760 --> 21:48.950
So I'll join your clan and help you.

21:49.330 --> 21:52.410
Why would you both do all that for me?

21:53.990 --> 21:56.900
Lots of people are grateful to you.

21:56.900 --> 22:03.920
You're always protecting us, so it's not odd
 to want to help you out sometimes, right?

22:03.920 --> 22:05.630
Ms. Nin is right.

22:06.590 --> 22:08.100
Are you sure about this?

22:08.100 --> 22:12.330
Of course we are, 
so stop looking so miserable.

22:14.160 --> 22:16.350
You should do what you want to do.

22:19.250 --> 22:20.150
Brother.

22:21.200 --> 22:22.250
Manicia!

22:23.570 --> 22:25.320
You should be in bed.

22:30.010 --> 22:35.540
I'm no longer the person 
you've had to protect all this time.

22:36.000 --> 22:39.960
Like Luna, I love this town.

22:40.430 --> 22:44.500
If there's a way for you 
to protect this town,

22:45.130 --> 22:47.720
then I'd like you to do that.

22:52.220 --> 22:55.140
I feel fine now.

22:58.210 --> 23:02.720
<i>She's hardly fine, but after seeing that...</i>

23:05.960 --> 23:07.530
I take back what I said.

23:10.370 --> 23:12.950
I'll protect Manicia and this town.

23:13.600 --> 23:15.660
So I'd like your help.

23:16.120 --> 23:17.000
Sure.
